        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The assistant now recognizes long waits for free models as final limits instead of temporary errors. It applies when a free request is denied and the server says to wait a minute or longer; shorter waits are still retried as before. You will immediately see that you have hit a free-model limit and can try later, rather than being told your purchase was refunded and your session ended.",
